، بينما يواصل موراي محاولاته لتكوين صداقات مع معلمته.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.5}],"value":6.5,"age":"PG-13"},"background_color":"","current_season_id":19225,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}